  "guid": "flir.enemymarkers",
  "name": "Enemy Markers",
  "slug": "enemy-markers",
  "teaser": "Simply a Marker that shows the enemies with a \"v\" shaped marker. Can also display the distance from the enemy.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2509.png",
  "downloads": 17697,
  "favourites_count": 13,
  "description": "<p><strong>I (APerson) AM NOT THE ORIGINAL CREATOR OF THIS MOD</strong></p>\n<p>This mod gives you the ability to spot an enemy and have a Marker showing where they are for <strong>5 Seconds</strong>.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers/-/raw/master/resources/scav.png?ref_type=heads&amp;inline=false\" alt=\"scav scoped\" /></p>\n<p>Configurable:</p>\n<p>Marker character</p>\n<p>Size</p>\n<p>Distance / Radius from center</p>\n<p>Color by “player” category (Bear/Usec/Scav/Boss …)</p>\n<p>To install just unzip at the root of your SPT folder and it will create a <code>BepInEx\\\\plugins\\\\flir.enemymarkers</code> directory for you</p>\n<h3>If you want to help in the development of this mod you are welcome to propose merge requests or issues on its project page: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://gitlab.com/flir063-spt/enemymarkers</a></h3>\n<p>Do not make requests somewhere else than gitlab as I would not see them, I (flir) am not the “author” of this mod, just an additional author.</p>\n<p>Special Thx to Level-Yellow-316 on Reddit for originally making this mod.</p>\n<p>Known Issues</p>\n<p>none ATM</p>\n",
